                                "sense_id": "e0a2a5f7-1635-3d55-8d13-508f1f436886",
                                "text": "\"I am a little overtired by my drive, my dear,\" said he, creeping from the blaze of daylight towards a snug sofa beside the fireplace."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca087f93-8a8e-4630-bf3b-d1f1317392c7",
                                "sense_id": "e0a2a5f7-1635-3d55-8d13-508f1f436886",
                                "text": "\"Today is what day?\" I asked.\n\"It's Monday, Caelum. Monday, the nineteenth.\"\n\"Monday. Yeah, that's right. I'm a little disoriented.\"\n\"Well, that's understandable. You were travelling all day yesterday. Plus, the time change. And you're probably overtired on top of that.\""
                            }
                        ]
